{"id":"portswigger-web-security-academy--server-side-vulnerabilities--access-control--user-id-controlled-by-request-parameter-with-password-disclosure","path":"portswigger-web-security-academy/server-side-vulnerabilities/access-control/user-id-controlled-by-request-parameter-with-password-disclosure.md","title":"User ID controlled by request parameter with password disclosure","category":"portswigger-web-security-academy","source":"https://github.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/blob/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/portswigger-web-security-academy/server-side-vulnerabilities/access-control/user-id-controlled-by-request-parameter-with-password-disclosure.md","html":"<h1 id=\"user-id-controlled-by-request-parameter-with-password-disclosure\">User ID controlled by request parameter with password disclosure</h1>\n<h4 id=\"horizontal-to-vertical-privilege-escalation\"><a href=\"https://portswigger.net/web-security/learning-paths/server-side-vulnerabilities-apprentice/access-control-apprentice/access-control/horizontal-to-vertical-privilege-escalation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Horizontal to vertical privilege escalation</a></h4>\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p>This lab has user account page that contains the current user's existing password, prefilled in a masked input.</p>\n<p>To solve the lab, retrieve the administrator's password, then use it to delete the user <code>carlos</code>.</p>\n<p>You can log in to your own account using the following credentials: <code>wiener:peter</code></p>\n<h2 id=\"solution\">Solution</h2>\n<figure><button type=\"button\" class=\"image-expand\" aria-label=\"Expand User ID controlled by request parameter with password disclosure screenshot\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/.gitbook/assets/image%20(16)%20(1)%20(1).png\" alt=\"User ID controlled by request parameter with password disclosure screenshot\"></button><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n\n<p>we can start login as wiener user</p>\n<figure><button type=\"button\" class=\"image-expand\" aria-label=\"Expand User ID controlled by request parameter with password disclosure screenshot\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/.gitbook/assets/image%20(17)%20(1)%20(1).png\" alt=\"User ID controlled by request parameter with password disclosure screenshot\"></button><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n\n<p>Checking this request we can see that this page has as the username 'wiener' as id parameter</p>\n<figure><button type=\"button\" class=\"image-expand\" aria-label=\"Expand User ID controlled by request parameter with password disclosure screenshot\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/.gitbook/assets/image%20(18)%20(1)%20(1).png\" alt=\"User ID controlled by request parameter with password disclosure screenshot\"></button><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n\n<p>and in the response there's a cleartext password!</p>\n<figure><button type=\"button\" class=\"image-expand\" aria-label=\"Expand User ID controlled by request parameter with password disclosure screenshot\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/.gitbook/assets/image%20(19)%20(1)%20(1).png\" alt=\"User ID controlled by request parameter with password disclosure screenshot\"></button><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n\n<p>So, trying to change the id with 'admnistrator' we're able to disclosure administrator's password:</p>\n<figure><button type=\"button\" class=\"image-expand\" aria-label=\"Expand User ID controlled by request parameter with password disclosure screenshot\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/.gitbook/assets/image%20(20)%20(1)%20(1).png\" alt=\"User ID controlled by request parameter with password disclosure screenshot\"></button><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n\n<figure><button type=\"button\" class=\"image-expand\" aria-label=\"Expand User ID controlled by request parameter with password disclosure screenshot\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/.gitbook/assets/image%20(21)%20(1)%20(1).png\" alt=\"User ID controlled by request parameter with password disclosure screenshot\"></button><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n\n<p>Now we can login as administrator, access to Admin panel and delte 'Carlos' user completing the lab!</p>\n<figure><button type=\"button\" class=\"image-expand\" aria-label=\"Expand User ID controlled by request parameter with password disclosure screenshot\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/.gitbook/assets/image%20(22)%20(1)%20(1).png\" alt=\"User ID controlled by request parameter with password disclosure screenshot\"></button><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n\n<figure><button type=\"button\" class=\"image-expand\" aria-label=\"Expand User ID controlled by request parameter with password disclosure screenshot\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/.gitbook/assets/image%20(23)%20(1)%20(1).png\" alt=\"User ID controlled by request parameter with password disclosure screenshot\"></button><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n\n<figure><button type=\"button\" class=\"image-expand\" aria-label=\"Expand User ID controlled by request parameter with password disclosure screenshot\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/.gitbook/assets/image%20(24)%20(1)%20(1).png\" alt=\"User ID controlled by request parameter with password disclosure screenshot\"></button><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n","toc":[{"id":"horizontal-to-vertical-privilege-escalation","title":"Horizontal to vertical privilege escalation","level":4},{"id":"description","title":"Description","level":2},{"id":"solution","title":"Solution","level":2}],"excerpt":"User ID controlled by request parameter with password disclosure Horizontal to vertical privilege escalation Description This lab has user account page that contains the current user's existing password, prefilled in a m","searchText":"Horizontal to vertical privilege escalation Description Solution"}